// Placeholder mounted in place of nginx.alloy on hosts that do not serve
// vhosts, which is the default. Deliberately declares nothing.
//
// A host that serves sites sets NGINX_ALLOY_CONFIG=./nginx.alloy in .env
// and mounts its log directory and GeoIP database; see .env.template.
//
// This exists rather than mounting /dev/null so that what Alloy loads is
// always a real, readable, obviously-empty file.
